              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi yamnika uSolomoni udumo olukhulu phambi kwabo bonke abakoIsrayeli, yamnika ubukhosi obungazanga bube khona kwenye inkosi ngaphambi kwakhe koIsrayeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.25",
