              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "isikhathi sokubusa kwakhe sasiyiminyaka engamatshumi amane; wabusa eHebroni iminyaka eyisikhombisa, eJerusalema iminyaka engamatshumi amathathu lantathu.",
